{"version":1,"content":"<p>近期憑韓劇《100日的謊言》人氣再升的韓國女神金裕貞，今日心情靚爆由首爾仁川國際機場出發，來港參加明日在中環大館舉行的電影首映禮活動。</p><p>已換上冬裝的她甜笑派心，狀態大勇，至於男星朴炯植亦將現身同一活動。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:24:28.860566+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:16:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:18:07.101132+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:18:07.101132+00:00","content_hash":"ccd60c75d52bf2181db47340b6e203890c44acb253364b725f14cda6f3e7441a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}